<title>NETHERLANDS: NUTRECO SHARES OPEN AT 44.50 GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>NUTRECO SHARES OPEN AT 44.50 GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch animal and fish feeds group Nutreco opened at 44.50 guilders when they started trading on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The price of the shares in the initial public offering had been set at 37.00 guilders each, the top of the initial price range.</p>
<p>The final number of shares on offer was set at 15.126 million.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (c) Reuters Limited 1997</p>
